ce oneself","chinese":"做自我介绍"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:6f2f58c6b0a6","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使…相互认识","contexts":["two people"]},{"id":"introduce:o:26e47df22ea5","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"主持","glossesEn":["announce"],"domains":["Television","Radio"],"contexts":["programme","item"]},{"id":"introduce:o:804431bd403f","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"引出","glossesEn":["occur at start of"],"contexts":["piece","article","film"],"examples":[{"english":"each chapter is introduced by a quotation","chinese":"每章的开头都有一段引文"},{"english":"the scene that introduces Act 5","chinese":"第5幕开始的那一场"},{"english":"she introduced her talk with a short film","chinese":"她播放了一个电影短片作为谈话的引子"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:59ea60c52c20","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使初次了解","glossesEn":["bring to attention of"],"examples":[{"english":"the foundation course introduces students to the basics","chinese":"基础课程向学生介绍基础知识"},{"english":"she has introduced many people to the pleasures of wine-tasting","chinese":"她使很多人体会到了品尝葡萄酒的乐趣"},{"english":"it was her brother who introduced her to smoking","chinese":"是她哥哥教会她吸烟的"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:95354fc72a63","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"初次提及","glossesEn":["mention for first time"],"examples":[{"english":"two new characters are introduced in Chapter 6","chinese":"第6章出现了两个新人物"},{"english":"to try to introduce the subject into the conversation","chinese":"试图将话题引入到谈话中"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:ee96c5eefb66","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"引入","glossesEn":["bring in for the first time"],"contexts":["person","animal","plant"],"examples":[{"english":"let's introduce a bit of colour","chinese":"我们来添加一点色彩"},{"english":"it introduced a bit of drama into our lives","chinese":"它为我们的生活带来了一些戏剧性"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:29105e1c3651","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"传入","contexts":["disease"]},{"id":"introduce:o:e830766d7b9e","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"添加","contexts":["uncertainty","excitement"]},{"id":"introduce:o:cfc01bdbc0f7","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"偷偷带入","glossesEn":["surreptitiously"],"contexts":["camera","bomb"]},{"id":"introduce:o:644751bfde98","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"推行","glossesEn":["bring into use or operation"],"examples":[{"english":"new legislation has just been introduced","chinese":"新法律刚刚开始实施"},{"english":"the company is introducing a new model next year","chinese":"公司明年将推出一种新型产品"},{"english":"computers were first introduced into schools in the 1970s","chinese":"计算机于20世纪70年代首次在学校中使用"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:a179f78b7f29","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"将…提交讨论","domains":["Politics"],"examples":[{"english":"to introduce a bill","chinese":"提交议案"}]},{"id":"introduce:o:8ef69383b7ef","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"插入","glossesEn":["insert"],"contexts":["needle","tube"]},{"id":"introduce:o:e841eaaa6862","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"添入","contexts":["substance"]}]},"irregular":{"senses":[{"id":"irregular:o:b83b51a0ab05","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"不规则的","glossesEn":["in shape"],"contexts":["outline","pattern"]},{"id":"irregular:o:b516d9bf9dde","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"不平整的","contexts":["surface"]},{"id":"irregular:o:5d4d05054c67","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"无规律的","glossesEn":["intermittent"],"examples":[{"english":"at irregular intervals","chinese":"不定期地"},{"english":"an irregular heartbeat","chinese":"不齐的心律"},{"english":"he's very irregular in his attendance at my class","chinese":"我的课他经常缺席"}]},{"id":"irregular:o:0af5c4e61ae9","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"不合常规的","glossesEn":["in practice, routine"],"examples":[{"english":"irregular financial dealings","chinese":"违规金融交易"}]},{"id":"irregular:o:3bb74d27ff41","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"不规则的","domains":["Linguistics"],"examples":[{"english":"an irregular verb","chinese":"不规则动词"}]}]},"like":{"senses":[{"id":"like:o:e97e4513135f","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"像","glossesEn":["similar to, resembling"],"examples":[{"english":"you know what she's like!","chinese":"你知道她的为人了吧！"},{"english":"what's the film like?","chinese":"那部电影怎么样？"},{"english":"it looks like rain","chinese":"看样子要下雨了"}]},{"id":"like:o:89f0bf76aa9a","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"像…一样","glossesEn":["in the manner of"],"examples":[{"english":"she spoke like an aristocrat","chinese":"她说起话来像个贵族"},{"english":"like me, she loves swimming","chinese":"她像我一样喜欢游泳"},{"english":"it happened like this …","chinese":"事情是这样的…"}]},{"id":"like:o:eb36da6a30c2","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"符合…的特点","glossesEn":["typical of"],"examples":[{"english":"that's just like him!","chinese":"他就是这么一个人！"},{"english":"it's not like her to be late","chinese":"她才不会迟到呢"},{"english":"like father, like son","chinese":"有其父必有其子"}]},{"id":"like:o:804b6a1ebd24","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"大约","glossesEn":["close to, approximately"],"examples":[{"english":"it will cost something like £100","chinese":"这大概要花100英镑"},{"english":"it'll cost more like £200","chinese":"更确切地说，这要花差不多200英镑"},{"english":"he's called Rufus or Rudolph or something like that","chinese":"他好像叫鲁弗斯或鲁道夫之类的名字"}]},{"id":"like:o:d3f181ef91a0","label":"prep.","definitionZh":"例如","glossesEn":["such as, for example"],"examples":[{"english":"big countries like India","chinese":"印度这类大国"},{"english":"the basic necessities of life like food and drink","chinese":"诸如食物和饮料之类的基本生活必需品"}]},{"id":"like:o:fbbb210b26e8","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"类似的","examples":[{"english":"people of like minds","chinese":"志趣相投的人"},{"english":"eating, drinking, and like activities","chinese":"吃喝之类的活动"},{"english":"to be of like mind on this issue","chinese":"在这个问题上意见一致"}]},{"id":"like:o:669c3f23813c","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"像…一样","glossesEn":["in the same way as"],"examples":[{"english":"do it like I do","chinese":"照我的做"},{"english":"you don't know him like I do","chinese":"你不像我那么了解他"},{"english":"like I said, I wasn't there","chinese":"正如我说过的，我当时不在那儿"}]},{"id":"like:o:c8f9f4b3a7ab","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"好像","glossesEn":["as if"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"he behaved like he was afraid","chinese":"他表现得好像很害怕"},{"english":"it looks like it's going to rain","chinese":"看起来像要下雨"}]},{"id":"like:o:a2c4a744d3c2","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"差不多","glossesEn":["nearly"],"examples":[{"english":"the sequel is nothing like as good as the original","chinese":"续集远远不如原作"},{"english":"if it's anything like as cold as today …","chinese":"要是像今天这样冷…"},{"english":"more like","chinese":"倒更像是"}]},{"id":"like:o:aff20e42586a","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"可以说","glossesEn":["so to speak"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"I felt embarrassed, like","chinese":"可以这么说，我觉得尴尬"},{"english":"it was, like, Christmas, so we wanted to have some fun","chinese":"这么说吧，那天是圣诞节，所以我们想找点乐子"}]},{"id":"like:o:2e6486dcf1e8","label":"n.","definitionZh":"类似的事物","glossesEn":["similar thing"],"examples":[{"english":"did you ever see the like (of it)?","chinese":"你见过这种东西吗？"},{"english":"judges, lawyers, and the like","chinese":"法官、律师等人士"},{"english":"to compare like with like","chinese":"同类相比"}]},{"id":"like:o:0a7be1412404","label":"n.","definitionZh":"类似的人","glossesEn":["similar person"]},{"id":"like:o:ed10daad1bcc","label":"n.","definitionZh":"爱好","glossesEn":["something liked"]},{"id":"like:o:4a4c1095a988","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"喜欢","glossesEn":["find agreeable"],"examples":[{"english":"the boss won't like it if you're late","chinese":"你要是迟到，老板会不高兴的"},{"english":"he is well liked by his colleagues","chinese":"他的同事都很喜欢他"},{"english":"to like swimming/to swim","chinese":"喜欢游泳"}]},{"id":"like:o:4ed54f7d775d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"想要","glossesEn":["want"],"examples":[{"english":"I would or should like some coffee, please","chinese":"请给我来点咖啡"},{"english":"I like people to be punctual","chinese":"我希望人们守时"},{"english":"I don't like to disturb her","chinese":"我不想打扰她"}]}]},"microbiology":{"senses":[{"id":"microbiology:o:f444304b4123","label":"n.","definitionZh":"微生物学"}]},"mystery":{"senses":[{"id":"mystery:o:c5da110f49d8","label":"n.","definitionZh":"神秘事物","glossesEn":["puzzle"],"examples":[{"english":"an unsolved myste