ou'll get what you want","chinese":"心诚则灵"}]},{"id":"wish:o:4b5ffc266d5d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"但愿","glossesEn":["expressing longing"],"examples":[{"english":"I wish I were taller/rich ,","chinese":"我要是个头高些/有钱就好了"},{"english":"he wishes his mother would phone","chinese":"他真希望他妈妈会打电话来"},{"english":"where is he now? — I only wish I knew!","chinese":"他现在在哪儿？──我要是知道就好了！"}]},{"id":"wish:o:5f53476e308c","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"希望","glossesEn":["demand"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"that was what your father would have wished","chinese":"你父亲也会这么希望的"},{"english":"you can stay until tomorrow if you wish","chinese":"如果你愿意，你可以待到明天"},{"english":"we wish nothing but peace","chinese":"我们只要和平"}]},{"id":"wish:o:397ea05f6dfe","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"想要","glossesEn":["want"]},{"id":"wish:o:24daff594c54","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"祝愿","glossesEn":["expressing hope"],"contexts":["happiness","joy"],"examples":[{"english":"I wish you every success!","chinese":"我祝你万事成功！"},{"english":"to wish sb no ill or harm","chinese":"不希望某人倒霉"},{"english":"to wish sb good luck/the best of luck","chinese":"祝某人好运/鸿运当头"}]},{"id":"wish:o:78b703a62ea7","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"祝愿","glossesEn":["expressing greetings"],"examples":[{"english":"to wish sb good morning/night","chinese":"向某人道早安/晚安"},{"english":"to wish sb many happy returns of the day","chinese":"祝某人福寿绵长"}]},{"id":"wish:o:ff860f255752","label":"n.","definitionZh":"愿望","glossesEn":["desire"],"examples":[{"english":"her wish came true!","chinese":"她的愿望实现啦！"},{"english":"the fairy gave her three wishes","chinese":"仙女让她许三个愿"},{"english":"to have/express/cherish/nurture a wish","chinese":"有/表达/怀有/心怀一个愿望"}]},{"id":"wish:o:2d6352aa1749","label":"n.","definitionZh":"想要的东西","glossesEn":["desired thing"]},{"id":"wish:o:2baba41f6ede","label":"n. pl.","definitionZh":"祝愿","examples":[{"english":"good/best wishes","chinese":"美好/最好的祝愿"},{"english":"to offer/send good wishes (to sb/for sth)","chinese":"（向某人/某事物）致以/送上美